{"title": "Shield (spell)", "pageid": 2704, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shield_(spell)", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Reactions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the mundane item, see <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(item)\" title=\"Shield (item)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(item)\" title=\"Shield (item)\">Shield</a>. For the equipment type, see <a href=\"/wiki/Shields_(equipment)\" title=\"Shields (equipment)\">Shields (equipment)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Shield_spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Shield_spell.webp/300px-Shield_spell.webp, /w/images/e/e2/Shield_spell.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Shield_spell.webp/300px-Shield_spell.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Shield_spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Shield</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 abjuration spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to avoid being hit by an enemy attack at the last possible instant. It also nullifies Magic Missile damage against them.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nWhen you are about to be hit by an enemy, use your <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to increase your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> by 5. You also take no damage from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a>. These effects last until the start of your next turn.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Shield_Wizard</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Shield_Wizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Shield_Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Wizard version</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Shield_Sorcerer</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Shield_Sorcerer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Shield_Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Sorcerer version</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Shield_Warlock</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Shield_Warlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Shield_Warlock\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Warlock version</div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Shield\"> Condition: Shield </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Shield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Shield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Shield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Shield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Shield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield (Condition)\">Shield</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Immune to Magic Missile. <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> is increased by 5.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\">The Hexblade</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\">Magic Initiate: Sorcerer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Harpers\" title=\"Amulet of the Harpers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Amulet_Necklace_F_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Harpers\" title=\"Amulet of the Harpers\">Amulet of the Harpers</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Shielding\" title=\"Shield of Shielding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Shield_of_Shielding_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Shielding\" title=\"Shield of Shielding\">Shield of Shielding</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elegant_Studded_Leather\" title=\"Elegant Studded Leather\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elegant_Studded_Leather\" title=\"Elegant Studded Leather\">Elegant Studded Leather</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell does not trigger <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Rot_(Condition)\" title=\"Spell Rot (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Rot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Rot_(Condition)\" title=\"Spell Rot (Condition)\">Spell Rot</a>.</li>\n<li>If a character with more than one class using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/38px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/50px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> as its <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_ability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting ability\">Spellcasting ability</a> wants this spell (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Hexblade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Class_Warlock_Hexblade_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\">The Hexblade</a>) both classes can select it.</li>\n<li>While the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Trickster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Knight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a> classes share the same <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_ability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting ability\">Spellcasting ability</a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/38px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/50px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intelligence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>), this spell cannot be picked multiple times via these classes on the same character, following these rules:\n<ul><li>A <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Class_Wizard_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a> selection will always be replaced by the two others as it is considered less efficient.</li>\n<li>Once selected by either <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Trickster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Class_Rogue_Arcane_Trickster_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Knight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Class_Fighter_Eldritch_Knight_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a>, it will not be available for the other.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, Shield does not grant charges of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Ward (Condition)\">Arcane Ward</a>.</li>\n<li>Due to an incomplete list of spell checks, Shield will not reduce the damage of Magic Missiles from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Arcanist\" title=\"Illithid Arcanist\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png/20px-Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png/30px-Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png/40px-Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Illithid Arcanists\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png/20px-Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Illithid_Arcanist.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Arcanist\" title=\"Illithid Arcanist\">Illithid Arcanists</a> for the rest of the turn <i>after</i> Shield is used as a reaction.</li>\n<li>When provided by an item, Shield does not provide any beneficial effects which would otherwise normally last until the start of the caster's next turn.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_(spell)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield (spell)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_(spell)\">Shield (